    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1966-42/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.47571399999999997
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Your letter has arrived.",
      "path": "audio/1966-42/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.760272,
      "end": 2.960635
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "You ask me about sex.",
      "path": "audio/1966-42/03.mp3",
      "start": 4.29356,
      "end": 5.650295
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "That energy too belongs to God and through meditation it too can be transformed.",
      "path": "audio/1966-42/04.mp3",
      "start": 6.876893,
      "end": 11.286712
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "No energy is bad but there can, of course, be wrong use of energy.",
      "path": "audio/1966-42/05.mp3",
      "start": 12.409252,
      "end": 15.777913999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "When sex energy flows upwards it turns into brahmacharya (godly behavior).",
      "path": "audio/1966-42/06.mp3",
      "start": 17.056213,
      "end": 21.746644
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "It is good that you are becoming detached from it but that isn't enough.",
      "path": "audio/1966-42/07.mp3",
      "start": 23.255397,
      "end": 27.413265000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "You have to go through it to transform it, rejection just leaves you arid and dry!",
      "path": "audio/1966-42/08.mp3",
      "start": 28.928162999999998,
      "end": 34.179818999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "It is true you are not alone in your sex life but sex is not essentially of the body at all but a modification of the mind.",
      "path": "audio/1966-42/09.mp3",
      "start": 35.736757000000004,
      "end": 44.048956999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "If the mind is completely transformed it affects the other person too, and one who is related so intimately is quickly affected",
      "path": "audio/1966-42/10.mp3",
      "start": 45.476168,
      "end": 54.83
    }
  ]
}
